				<title>SCP-5083</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5083</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #: SCP-5083&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class: Safe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5083 is to be kept in a wooden box measuring 5.5 inches in width and 3.5 inches in length. Due to SCP-5083 being used for personal gain becoming a possibility, SCP-5083&#039;s box is to be under 24/7 surveillance. Any individual attempting to interact in any way with SCP-5083 without authorization from the 05-Council is to be immediately terminated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5083 is a standard black universal tv remote measuring 2 inches in width and 7.5 inches in length. Despite SCP-5083 being a tv remote, it has no observable space to insert batteries. Each button on SCP-5038 seemingly has a different effect on reality but can be made to affect one specific item or individual by pointing SCP-5083 at the target and pressing a button.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test logs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackson545&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3765398&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606272407&quot; alt=&quot;Jackson545&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3765398)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackson545&quot;  &gt;Jackson545&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
