<p><strong>Orientation:</strong> polyam bi ace</p> <p><strong>Ethnicity:</strong> Japanese/Okinawan</p> <p><strong>Citizenship:</strong> American, Japanese</p> <p><strong>Likes:</strong> cats, raw fish, metafiction</p> <p><strong>Dislikes:</strong> sour food, horror</p> <p><strong>Other:</strong> Well see how long this lasts this time.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h1><span>Works</span></h1> <div id="wiki-tabview-e7599107e5377e7fc4860dfd434234e0" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>SCPs</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Tales</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Guides/Essays</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Other</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <h3><span>Prose:</span></h3> <h3><span>Poetry:</span></h3> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ghostchibi-art" target="_blank">Ghostchibi's SCP Art</a></p> <p><a href="http://kaktuskontainer.wikidot.com/ghostchibi-sandbox-hub" target="_blank">Ghostchibi's sandbox hub</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> pester vs blackwood.png<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> pester vs blackwood.png<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostchibi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1382994&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606272412" alt="ghostchibi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1382994)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostchibi" >ghostchibi</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/jr-psych-chibis-personnel-file">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/jr-psych-chibis-personnel-file</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostchibi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1382994&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606272412" alt="ghostchibi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1382994)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostchibi" >ghostchibi</a></span></p> 
