 href="http://www.scpwiki.com/except-it-is">This Is Not Me Talking</a> - <em>Dmatix</em><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/resurrection">Resurrection</a> - <em>thedeadlymoose</em><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/nothing-and-five-and-five">Nothing and Five and Five</a> - <em>Dmatix</em><br /> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/walk-the-floor">Walk the Floor</a> - <em>Djoric</em><br /> <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/etdp-hub-page">Et Tam Deum Petivi Hub Page</a></strong></p> <p><strong>Outro</strong> (1:11:59 - 1:13:46)</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Episode&nbsp;21:&nbsp;qntm</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;Collapsible</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="content-panel standalone series"> <h2><span><strong>KaktusKast Episode 21:</strong> qntm</span></h2> <p><em>Ever thought about antimemes? No? Me neither, and for good reason. To enlighten us as to why that is, the KaktusKast is proud to welcome qntm to this week's show! Author of the acclaimed SCP-055 and tales like &quot;We Need To Talk About Fifty-Five&quot;, qntm has been breaking new ground in the Foundationverse for years. Sit down, have yourself a listen, and break the hiatus with host djkaktus as he and qntm talk about memes, antimemes, and every meme in between!</em><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <blockquote> <p><a href="https://www.djkakt.us/kaktuskast/2017/7/7/the-kaktuskast-ep-21-qntm">The Kaktuskast Episode 21</a></p> </blockquote> </div> <p><strong>Kaktus Pick-of-the-Week:</strong> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/death-and-the-doctors-hub">Death and the Doctors Hub</a> - <em>Dmatix</em></p> <p>Go visit qntm's site at <a href="http://qntm.org/">http://qntm.org/</a>! Lots of origin