&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kate-mctiriss&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1223059&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606272416&quot; alt=&quot;Kate McTiriss&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1223059)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kate-mctiriss&quot;  &gt;Kate McTiriss&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-760008-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;SDECotW&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-760008-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. This effect spreads to all forms of digital storage. Affected devices have thus far included consumer-grade computers, mobile telephones, and graphing calculators. Mechanical storage devices, writing, and physical representations of lists are not changed by SCP-001&#039;s anomalous properties.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-760008-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Original suspicions of cybercrime attracted the interest of the FBI. Embedded UIU agents in the FBI&#039;s Cyber Crime division turned over the object to Foundation custody after discovery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
